# rasayan — src/signaling.cyr: Rust 1.2.0's signaling network tests, ported
# Stdlib auto-included via cyrius.cyml
#
# The 13 unit tests of `signaling.rs` and the 3 integration tests (tests/integration.rs) that call only the network,
# as they are written; tests/golden/signaling.tsv checks every method, single tick and trajectory besides. Beyond
# them: the trace event and every codec's round trip.

